{% import 'landing/sections/_shot.html.twig' as shot %}

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════ STAFF CONSENSUS ═══════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="consensus-section" id="consensus">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Scouting &amp; Transfers</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Multi-perspective scouting &amp; agent dynamics</h2>
        <div class="consensus-inner">
            <div>
                <p class="section-sub">Never buy blind. Every signing runs the same chain: your Lead Scout files a report, the Director of Football sets it against recruitment priorities, the Manager weighs in on squad fit, and the final offer still needs your sign-off. Navigate agent personalities, sign-on fees, and squad role expectations to build a championship-winning squad without going bankrupt.</p>
                <br>
                <p class="section-sub" style="color: var(--text-muted);">Every scout works their own shortlist against the transfer list and free agent pool in parallel. Compare their reports, weigh conflicting staff opinions, and decide who's worth the fee.</p>
            </div>
            <figure class="role-visual">
                {{ shot.img('dof-scouting-priorities', 'Director of Football scouting priorities — positions, age brackets, and an emergency band-aid flag for a position that cannot field an XI', false, 260, '2026-10') }}
                <p class="ss-caption">Your DoF sets the priorities — you set the budget</p>
            </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-split is-reversed" style="margin-top:32px;">
            <figure class="feature-shot">
                {{ shot.img('agent-tiers', 'The agent directory — tabs for Elite, Reputable, Notable and Recognised, with a table of name, tier, rating and client-list count, most agents locked until a dossier is bought', false, 340, '2026-10') }}
                <figcaption>Six agent tiers, from Elite down to Unknown</figcaption>
            </figure>

            <div class="point-list">
                <div class="point">
                    <span class="point-title">Scarcity by design</span>
                    <p>Agents range Elite &rarr; Reputable &rarr; Notable &rarr; Recognised &rarr; Promising &rarr; Unknown. The best books are locked until you pay for access.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="point">
                    <span class="point-title">Buy the dossier</span>
                    <p>Unlock an agent's full client list and you unlock preferred financial rates on every player they represent — not just the one you were chasing.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="point">
                    <span class="point-title">Priorities, not guesswork</span>
                    <p>Your DoF sets recruitment priorities by position, age bracket and reach — including an emergency band-aid flag when you can't field a full XI.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="point">
                    <span class="point-title is-red">Executive Signings</span>
                    <p>As owner, you can bypass the whole pipeline and sign any player in the database within budget. Staff will share their opinions — an unwanted signing can cause friction — but the Manager decides whether he plays.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider">
